Package: garnish
Title: Python-Style Decorators for R
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Dyfan", "Jones", , "dyfan.r.jones@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Popular Python decorators ported to R with the 'adorn' framework:
    retrying, caching, context managers and argument validation.
